<Doc title="Medical disclaimer" lede="Please read this before acting on anything you find here.">
  <p>The Biological Edge shares personal experience and general educational information about health and fitness. It is not medical advice and is not a substitute for care from a qualified health professional.</p>
  <h2>We are not your doctor</h2>
  <p>Todd Funk is not a physician, pharmacist, dietitian or licensed health professional. When he describes his own treatment, including testosterone replacement therapy prescribed and monitored by a medical clinic, he is describing his experience. It is not a recommendation that you do the same.</p>
  <h2>Talk to a professional first</h2>
  <p>Speak with your doctor before you start or change an exercise programme, your diet, any supplement, sauna or cold exposure, or any medication. This matters most if you have a heart condition, high or low blood pressure, diabetes, kidney or liver disease, or take regular medication.</p>
  <h2>Supplements</h2>
  <p>Statements about supplements on this site are for general information. Supplements are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease, and they can interact with medication.</p>
  <h2>Results vary</h2>
  <p>What worked for one person may not work for you. Nothing on this site is a promise of a particular result.</p>
  <h2>Emergencies</h2>
  <p>If you think you are having a medical emergency, call 911 or go to your nearest emergency department. If you are in crisis or thinking about suicide, call or text 988 in Canada or the United States.</p>
